Z||000006||Cliff Pennock||01-24-2000||07:04 PM||||I found out what the problem with AOL is. Apparantly, AOL replaces some Windows libraries with their own. It seems a lot of internet proggies don't work after AOL has been installed...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I'm currently searching for a fix. As soon as I have one I'll let you know. In the mean time I will email you the manual configuration. Although I can't be sure <B>that</B> will work with AOL...||||reg||1
